    {
      "text": "Thank you for calling VeloFit. Your call may be recorded for quality assurance. Please wait while we connect you to the next available agent.",
      "speakerId": "AUTOMATED_AGENT",
      "role": "AUTOMATED_AGENT",
      "user_id": 0,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768253146000000
    },
    {
      "text": "Thank you for holding. You've reached VeloFit, my name is David. How can I help you today?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 304,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768253155600000
    },
    {
      "text": "I need to return something.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 27538,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768253161800000
    },
    {
      "text": "I can certainly help with that. Could I get your name and order number to start?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 304,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768253163800000
    },
    {
      "text": "Sarah Miller. The order is VF90210.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 27538,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768253169333333
    },
    {
      "text": "Thank you, Sarah. I'm pulling that up now... I see an order for the VeloPro cycling shoes. Is that the item you're looking to return?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 304,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768253171866666
    },
    {
      "text": "Obviously.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 27538,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768253180933332
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay. And what specifically is the issue with the shoes? Is it a technical fault or more of a preference?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 304,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768253181799998
    },
    {
      "text": "They gave me blisters. They're just terrible.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 27538,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768253188999998
    },
    {
      "text": "I'm sorry to hear that. I know how frustrating that can be. Just to be thorough, was there any issue with installing the cleats or anything like that?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 304,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768253192199998
    },
    {
      "text": "No, the cleats were fine. The shoes are the problem. I want a refund.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 27538,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768253202399998
    },
    {
      "text": "Of course. Let me just confirm the purchase date here... Okay, I see the delivery was 85 days ago. One moment while I check our policy.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 304,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768253207199998
    },
    {
      "text": "Sure. Take your time.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 27538,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768253216399998
    },
    {
      "text": "Thank you for your patience, Sarah. Good news. The cycling shoes fall under our 10-day return policy, so you're unfortunately outside the window. I can process this return for you right away.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 304,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768253217999998
    },
    {
      "text": "Amazing. A company that actually follows its own policy. A miracle.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 27538,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768253230266664
    },
    {
      "text": "I've just approved the return. I'm sending a pre-paid shipping label to the email we have on file. Please package the shoes in their original box and attach the label. Once our warehouse receives the item, your refund will be processed back to your original payment method.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 304,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768253234933330
    },
    {
      "text": "Fine. Whatever.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 27538,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768253253333330
    },
    {
